{"id":"28998181-790f-4113-8600-bae136e7b103","createdAt":"2026-10-27T05:15:41.684Z","batchId":"onboarding_minimax-m3-1-flash-gateway_high","approach":"html","modelId":"minimax-m3.1-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<section class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <div class=\"between\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h1>Create your account</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Set up your profile and choose how you’d like to use the service.</p>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"badge\" id=\"stepBadge\">Step 1 of 3</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"between\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Setup progress</span>\n        <span class=\"small muted\" id=\"progressLabel\">33% complete</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"progress\" aria-label=\"Onboarding progress\">\n        <div id=\"progressBar\" style=\"width:33%\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid cols-3 gap-sm\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn step-button\" data-step=\"0\" aria-current=\"step\">\n          <span class=\"badge\">1</span>\n          <span>Account</span>\n        </button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary step-button\" data-step=\"1\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">2</span>\n          <span>Preferences</span>\n        </button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary step-button\" data-step=\"2\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">3</span>\n          <span>Done</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <section data-panel=\"0\" aria-labelledby=\"accountHeading\">\n      <form id=\"accountForm\" class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h2 id=\"accountHeading\">Your account</h2>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Use your name and email address to create your account.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <label>\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Full name</span>\n            <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" value=\"Alex Morgan\" autocomplete=\"name\" required>\n          </label>\n\n          <label>\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Email address</span>\n            <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" value=\"alex.morgan@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" required>\n          </label>\n\n          <label>\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Password</span>\n            <input type=\"password\" name=\"password\" value=\"correct-horse-battery\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" minlength=\"8\" required>\n            <span class=\"small muted\">Use at least 8 characters.</span>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n\n    <section data-panel=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"preferencesHeading\" hidden>\n      <form id=\"preferencesForm\" class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h2 id=\"preferencesHeading\">Your preferences</h2>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Choose a few options so your experience feels right.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-sm\">\n          <label>\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Time zone</span>\n            <select name=\"timezone\" required>\n              <option value=\"America/New_York\">Eastern Time</option>\n              <option value=\"America/Chicago\">Central Time</option>\n              <option value=\"America/Denver\">Mountain Time</option>\n              <option value=\"America/Los_Angeles\" selected>Pacific Time</option>\n              <option value=\"Europe/London\">London</option>\n              <option value=\"Europe/Paris\">Central European Time</option>\n              <option value=\"Asia/Tokyo\">Japan Standard Time</option>\n            </select>\n          </label>\n\n          <label>\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Email frequency</span>\n            <select name=\"frequency\" required>\n              <option value=\"daily\" selected>Daily</option>\n              <option value=\"weekly\">Weekly</option>\n              <option value=\"monthly\">Monthly</option>\n              <option value=\"never\">Never</option>\n            </select>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n\n        <fieldset class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <legend class=\"stat-label\">Keep me updated</legend>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"product\" checked>\n            <span>Product announcements and new features</span>\n          </label>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"tips\" checked>\n            <span>Helpful tips and recommendations</span>\n          </label>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"research\">\n            <span>Occasional research and survey invitations</span>\n          </label>\n        </fieldset>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n\n    <section data-panel=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"doneHeading\" hidden>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"badge\">Account created</span>\n          <h2 id=\"doneHeading\">You’re all set, Alex!</h2>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Your account is ready. Here’s a summary of your setup.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"between\">\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Name</span>\n            <strong id=\"summaryName\">Alex Morgan</strong>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"between\">\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Email</span>\n            <strong id=\"summaryEmail\">alex.morgan@example.com</strong>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"between\">\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Time zone</span>\n            <strong id=\"summaryTimezone\">Pacific Time</strong>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"between\">\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Email frequency</span>\n            <strong id=\"summaryFrequency\">Daily</strong>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"alert\">\n          Your preferences have been saved. You can change them at any time from your account settings.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" id=\"backButton\" disabled>Back</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"nextButton\">Next</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"restartButton\" hidden>Start over</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<script>\n  const panels = [...document.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]')];\n  const stepButtons = [...document.querySelectorAll('.step-button')];\n  const accountForm = document.getElementById('accountForm');\n  const preferencesForm = document.getElementById('preferencesForm');\n  const progressBar = document.getElementById('progressBar');\n  const progressLabel = document.getElementById('progressLabel');\n  const stepBadge = document.getElementById('stepBadge');\n  const backButton = document.getElementById('backButton');\n  const nextButton = document.getElementById('nextButton');\n  const restartButton = document.getElementById('restartButton');\n  let currentStep = 0;\n\n  function updateSummary() {\n    const account = new FormData(accountForm);\n    const preferences = new FormData(preferencesForm);\n    document.getElementById('summaryName').textContent = account.get('name');\n    document.getElementById('summaryEmail').textContent = account.get('email');\n    document.getElementById('summaryTimezone').textContent = preferences.get('timezone').selectedOptions[0].text;\n    document.getElementById('summaryFrequency').textContent = preferences.get('frequency').selectedOptions[0].text;\n  }\n\n  function showStep(step) {\n    currentStep = step;\n    panels.forEach((panel, index) => {\n      panel.hidden = index !== step;\n    });\n\n    stepButtons.forEach((button, index) => {\n      const active = index === step;\n      button.classList.toggle('btn', active);\n      button.classList.toggle('btn-secondary', !active);\n      button.setAttribute('aria-current', active ? 'step' : 'false');\n      const badge = button.querySelector('.badge');\n      badge.classList.toggle('badge', active);\n      badge.classList.toggle('badge-secondary', !active);\n    });\n\n    const percentage = Math.round(((step + 1) / panels.length) * 100);\n    progressBar.style.width = percentage + '%';\n    progressLabel.textContent = percentage + '% complete';\n    stepBadge.textContent = 'Step ' + (step + 1) + ' of ' + panels.length;\n\n    backButton.disabled = step === 0;\n    nextButton.hidden = step === panels.length - 1;\n    restartButton.hidden = step !== panels.length - 1;\n    nextButton.textContent = step === panels.length - 2 ? 'Finish setup' : 'Next';\n\n    if (step === panels.length - 1) updateSummary();\n  }\n\n  nextButton.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    if (currentStep === 0 && !accountForm.reportValidity()) return;\n    if (currentStep === 1 && !preferencesForm.reportValidity()) return;\n    showStep(Math.min(currentStep + 1, panels.length - 1));\n  });\n\n  backButton.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    showStep(Math.max(currentStep - 1, 0));\n  });\n\n  restartButton.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    accountForm.reset();\n    preferencesForm.reset();\n    showStep(0);\n  });\n\n  stepButtons.forEach((button) => {\n    button.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const targetStep = Number(button.dataset.step);\n      if (targetStep > currentStep && !accountForm.reportValidity()) return;\n      if (targetStep > 1 && !preferencesForm.reportValidity()) return;\n      showStep(targetStep);\n    });\n  });\n</script>","deltas":[[23817,"<section"],[23825," class=\"page stack"],[23848," gap"],[23860,"-lg\">\n  <div class=\"between"],[23880,"\">\n    <div"],[24039," class=\"stack gap-sm"],[24076,"\">\n      <h1>Create"],[24076," your account</h1>\n      "],[24091,"<p class=\"lead\">Set up your"],[24174," profile and choose"],[24185," how"],[24185," you’d"],[24185," like to use the"],[24294," service.</p>\n    </div>\n"],[24304,"    <span class=\"badge\" id"],[24304,"=\"step"],[24304,"Badge"],[24304,"\">Step 1 of 3"],[24304,"</span>\n  </div>\n\n  "],[24313,"<div class=\"card stack"],[24341," gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\""],[24356,"stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class"],[24376,"=\"between\">\n        <span class=\""],[24404,"stat-label\">Setup progress"],[26176,"</span>\n        <span class=\""],[26296,"small muted\" id=\"progress"],[26397,"Label"],[26452,"\">33% complete"],[26462,"</span>\n      </div>\n     "],[26486," <div class=\"progress\" aria"],[26854,"-label=\"On"],[26863,"boarding progress\">\n        <div id"],[26863,"=\"progressBar"],[26863,"\" style=\"width:33"],[26863,"%\"></div>\n      </div>\n"],[26863,"      <div class=\"grid cols-"],[26863,"3 gap-sm\">\n        <button type"],[26863,"=\"button\" class=\"btn step"],[26863,"-button\" data-step=\"0"],[26864,"\" aria-current=\"step"],[26864,"\">\n          <span class=\"badge\">"],[26864,"1</span>\n"],[26864,"          <span>Account"],[26864,"</span>\n        </button>\n        "],[26864,"<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn"],[26888," btn-secondary step-button\" data-step=\""],[26903,"1\">\n          <span class=\"badge"],[26906," 